# gguf-download-list — models for download-gguf-series.sh
#
# One entry per line:   repo|filename-or-filter|cards
# cards: 5090 | 4070ti | both, or a comma list (5090,4070ti); the model is
# downloaded once and hardlinked into each card's models dir.
# Blank lines and '#' comments are ignored.
#
# Prefer the EXACT .gguf filename: hf's --include is case-sensitive, so a
# glob like "Q4_K_M" silently matches nothing on repos that ship "q4_k_m".
# (This is the bug that shipped in the old model-specific script.)
#
# Verified 262,144-context llama.cpp GGUF coder models (example entries):
Terathox-Coder/Qwen3.8-27B-MTP-GGUF|Qwen3.8-27B-Q4_K_M-MTP.gguf|5090
Jab1718/qwen3.8-flash-coder-26gb-gguf|qwen3.8-flash-coder-26gb-q4_k_m.gguf|5090
